WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.770
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:11.040 --> 00:11.780
What are you staring at?

3
00:15.440 --> 00:16.170
Master?

4
00:18.370 --> 00:19.060
Master!

5
00:20.920 --> 00:21.590
Master?

6
00:30.440 --> 00:31.130
Master?

7
00:34.390 --> 00:36.180
Is your master's true form a log?

8
00:37.520 --> 00:38.540
Don't talk about him like that.

9
00:44.280 --> 00:44.970
Master?

10
00:47.430 --> 00:48.410
Back in Luoshen Valley,

11
00:48.670 --> 00:49.170
Master said

12
00:49.170 --> 00:50.360
the soul crystal had been repaired.

13
00:50.750 --> 00:51.680
But it seems

14
00:51.880 --> 00:53.410
only his physical body has been restored.

15
00:53.540 --> 00:54.490
His spirit

16
00:54.560 --> 00:55.740
may only awaken

17
00:56.240 --> 00:57.370
once we're back in the present.

18
01:13.550 --> 01:14.220
Qi Fengyin,

19
01:14.600 --> 01:16.060
stay here and watch over my master.

20
01:18.550 --> 01:19.790
You can't exactly help Youyou

21
01:19.790 --> 01:20.650
with her love life, can you?

22
01:21.240 --> 01:22.450
Let's split the work.

23
01:22.750 --> 01:23.700
You stay here and look after

24
01:23.700 --> 01:24.640
my master's body.

25
01:24.750 --> 01:26.160
I'll help Youyou get betrothed

26
01:26.160 --> 01:26.890
and get the talisman.

27
01:27.960 --> 01:28.530
No.

28
01:30.310 --> 01:31.370
For my master's sake

29
01:32.190 --> 01:33.870
and for Youyou, who's in the Saintess's hands,

30
01:34.190 --> 01:35.210
this can't wait.

31
01:35.210 --> 01:35.880
You don't get to say no!

32
01:58.020 --> 02:03.900
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

33
02:05.940 --> 02:11.900
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

34
02:12.940 --> 02:17.180
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

35
02:20.860 --> 02:28.420
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

36
02:28.780 --> 02:35.540
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

37
02:36.780 --> 02:43.420
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

38
02:44.620 --> 02:51.460
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

39
02:53.060 --> 02:59.580
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

40
03:04.340 --> 03:06.140
[Blossom in Darkness]

41
03:06.140 --> 03:08.140
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

42
03:08.140 --> 03:11.140
[Episode 17]

43
03:25.240 --> 03:25.850
What are you doing?

44
03:27.240 --> 03:28.300
Why are you hiding your face?

45
03:28.520 --> 03:29.890
Are you afraid someone will recognize you?

46
03:31.240 --> 03:32.570
Why is everyone so scared of you?

47
03:33.270 --> 03:34.060
What's your true form?

48
03:40.360 --> 03:41.220
That's none of your business.

49
03:41.480 --> 03:42.510
With Qi Fengyin around,

50
03:42.510 --> 03:43.390
I can't eat you.

51
03:43.860 --> 03:45.060
But if you anger me,

52
03:45.280 --> 03:46.780
you're not getting the Demon Soul Talisman.

53
03:49.620 --> 03:51.010
Why are you taking me to Yunyi Sect?

54
03:52.190 --> 03:53.060
Have you come up with a plan?

55
03:55.360 --> 03:56.180
Yesterday, you only let me

56
03:56.180 --> 03:57.280
catch a glimpse of Shen Wangyan.

57
03:57.590 --> 03:59.070
How am I supposed to know

58
03:59.070 --> 03:59.770
his personality

59
03:59.770 --> 04:00.410
or what he likes?

60
04:00.560 --> 04:01.300
I know nothing about him.

61
04:01.300 --> 04:02.170
How can we appeal to his tastes?

62
04:02.870 --> 04:03.690
So of course we need

63
04:03.710 --> 04:04.610
to get to know him properly first.

64
04:04.730 --> 04:06.130
Then don't waste your time.

65
04:07.190 --> 04:08.500
I know everything there is to know

66
04:09.000 --> 04:10.220
about Shen Wangyan.

67
04:11.910 --> 04:12.660
Yunyi Sect

68
04:13.080 --> 04:14.730
[Yunyi Sect] is a minor immortal sect.

69
04:17.510 --> 04:19.220
As its leader, Shen Wangyan

70
04:19.560 --> 04:20.810
rarely leaves the sect grounds.

71
04:29.540 --> 04:33.900
♪Moonlight spills before Luoliang's towers♪

72
04:34.060 --> 04:37.660
♪The evening breeze caresses your face...♪

73
04:37.680 --> 04:39.370
He rises at the same time each morning to train

74
04:40.360 --> 04:41.250
and study cultivation techniques.

75
04:43.180 --> 04:48.060
♪Yet my longing only grows harder to soothe...♪

76
04:50.720 --> 04:52.660
At noon, he tends the herb garden,

77
04:53.510 --> 04:54.660
carefully looking after the sect's

78
04:54.720 --> 04:55.700
flowers and medicinal herbs.

79
04:57.860 --> 05:02.980
♪Let the years become two butterflies breaking free of their cocoons...♪

80
05:05.510 --> 05:07.410
He works hard at his own cultivation,

81
05:08.160 --> 05:09.980
takes great care of his disciples,

82
05:10.800 --> 05:13.050
and runs the sect's affairs efficiently.

83
05:13.060 --> 05:14.820
♪Grace in every step♪

84
05:15.660 --> 05:18.540
♪I wander the mortal world for you alone...♪

85
05:18.560 --> 05:19.460
There's just one thing

86
05:19.800 --> 05:20.780
I haven't figured out.

87
05:21.270 --> 05:22.810
Behind the platform where he plays his zither

88
05:23.240 --> 05:25.050
is a bamboo hut protected by a seal.

89
05:26.000 --> 05:27.610
He spends two hours in that hut

90
05:27.830 --> 05:28.900
every day,

91
05:29.830 --> 05:31.140
but I have no idea what for.

92
05:32.310 --> 05:32.980
What's more,

93
05:33.480 --> 05:34.810
every time he comes out,

94
05:35.310 --> 05:36.460
he's terribly weak.

95
05:37.680 --> 05:39.050
I've thought about going in to investigate,

96
05:39.510 --> 05:41.290
but if anyone triggers the seal,

97
05:41.920 --> 05:43.490
Shen Wangyan will know.

98
05:47.720 --> 05:49.490
Anyway, apart from that little hut,

99
05:49.950 --> 05:51.140
I know him

100
05:51.310 --> 05:52.140
inside out.

101
05:53.000 --> 05:53.660
I may

102
05:53.680 --> 05:54.930
have only spoken to him once,

103
05:55.190 --> 05:56.050
but I can tell

104
05:56.390 --> 05:58.220
he's a man of noble character,

105
05:58.360 --> 05:59.700
a truly kind and honorable man.

106
06:03.630 --> 06:05.320
If Shen Wangyan finds out you've been

107
06:05.320 --> 06:06.390
spying on him every day,

108
06:06.390 --> 06:07.220
I'm afraid

109
06:07.220 --> 06:08.050
you'll never make

110
06:08.050 --> 06:08.880
a good impression on him.

111
06:09.430 --> 06:10.250
Then what do I do?

112
06:10.680 --> 06:11.610
But I'm a demon!

113
06:14.430 --> 06:15.740
But I'm a demon.

114
06:16.070 --> 06:17.290
I can't just

115
06:17.290 --> 06:18.220
rush up to him

116
06:18.600 --> 06:19.660
and say,

117
06:19.870 --> 06:21.610
"I'm a good demon who doesn't kill needlessly,"

118
06:22.000 --> 06:22.540
can I?

119
06:23.160 --> 06:24.410
When you captured me,

120
06:25.040 --> 06:25.850
you didn't seem

121
06:25.870 --> 06:27.020
like a good demon who doesn't kill needlessly.

122
06:27.160 --> 06:28.050
You're not even human.

123
06:28.680 --> 06:29.610
Nor are you a demon.

124
06:29.720 --> 06:30.580
You're an herb spirit.

125
06:30.920 --> 06:32.220
So you don't count.

126
06:32.360 --> 06:33.540
Just tell me already.

127
06:33.680 --> 06:35.250
What exactly should I do next?

128
06:35.560 --> 06:36.170
Anyway,

129
06:36.360 --> 06:37.900
catering to his tastes won't work.

130
06:38.000 --> 06:39.700
I can't play a note on that zither.

131
06:41.240 --> 06:42.810
Even if you spy on him like this

132
06:43.480 --> 06:44.370
for 100 years,

133
06:44.560 --> 06:46.050
you'll never form a bond with him.

134
06:46.950 --> 06:47.830
We need to find a chance

135
06:47.830 --> 06:49.220
for you two to get to know each other.

136
06:51.070 --> 06:51.850
Find a chance.

137
06:59.480 --> 07:00.660
What are they doing?

138
07:02.750 --> 07:03.850
You mean the lanterns?

139
07:06.830 --> 07:07.780
Tomorrow is New Year's Day.

140
07:08.160 --> 07:09.490
There's a Demon Lantern Festival on New Year's Eve.

141
07:09.870 --> 07:11.760
- We demons love firelight. - Higher!

142
07:12.120 --> 07:12.700
Luoliang Demon Capital

143
07:12.720 --> 07:13.930
was only recently built,

144
07:14.360 --> 07:15.460
but we still

145
07:15.460 --> 07:16.580
observe these traditions.

146
07:18.750 --> 07:20.130
How about inviting Shen Wangyan here

147
07:20.310 --> 07:21.620
to spend New Year's Eve with you?

148
07:22.270 --> 07:24.460
Going to the Demon Lantern Festival together

149
07:25.160 --> 07:26.770
will help you get to know each other better.

150
07:27.750 --> 07:28.580
Let him see how

151
07:28.920 --> 07:30.370
the demons here live and work in peace,

152
07:30.680 --> 07:31.540
making a living by farming,

153
07:32.040 --> 07:33.220
without ever troubling mortals.

154
07:33.720 --> 07:34.490
Then

155
07:34.600 --> 07:35.590
I'll secretly arrange

156
07:35.590 --> 07:37.100
a few little incidents to bring you closer,

157
07:37.100 --> 07:38.170
and sparks are bound to fly.

158
07:43.430 --> 07:44.730
He's from an immortal sect.

159
07:45.070 --> 07:46.290
What if he refuses to come here?

160
07:47.800 --> 07:50.140
Then we'll just have to resort

161
07:50.390 --> 07:52.020
to some extraordinary measures.

162
08:00.870 --> 08:02.100
My master can't move.

163
08:02.390 --> 08:03.050
Make sure

164
08:03.270 --> 08:04.810
you take him outside for some sun often.

165
08:05.160 --> 08:06.540
It'll help his spirit recover.

166
08:06.920 --> 08:08.980
If I just tossed you out the window,

167
08:09.950 --> 08:11.140
she'd get upset again.

168
08:31.500 --> 08:33.180
[Huanxia Pavilion]

169
08:50.150 --> 08:52.180
How can my malice be here?

170
08:53.790 --> 08:55.060
It's so faint.

171
08:56.440 --> 08:57.650
Am I imagining it?

172
09:14.150 --> 09:14.700
Qi Fengyin?

173
09:19.670 --> 09:20.650
Why are you carrying my master?

174
09:22.360 --> 09:23.980
Didn't you say he needed more sun?

175
09:25.840 --> 09:27.300
You could've just gotten him a chair.

176
09:27.600 --> 09:28.890
No need to keep carrying him like this.

177
09:29.630 --> 09:31.420
Take him back upstairs first.

178
09:31.670 --> 09:32.770
There's something more important to do.

179
09:32.840 --> 09:33.530
It's an emergency.

180
09:41.780 --> 09:44.420
[Yaohua Garden]

181
09:57.960 --> 09:58.460
Master,

182
09:58.910 --> 09:59.830
two devils, a man and a woman,

183
09:59.830 --> 10:00.540
have stormed in

184
10:00.550 --> 10:01.760
and are wreaking havoc!

185
10:02.200 --> 10:03.460
We can't hold them off!

186
10:03.630 --> 10:04.060
What?

187
10:04.860 --> 10:06.020
[Yunyi Sect]

188
10:07.750 --> 10:08.940
Who dares cause trouble here?

189
10:09.840 --> 10:10.700
Master!

190
10:15.750 --> 10:17.340
Yunyi Sect has always sought peace.

191
10:17.600 --> 10:19.060
We have no quarrel with either of you.

192
10:19.480 --> 10:20.530
Why are you attacking our sect?

193
10:22.630 --> 10:24.010
My travels brought me here.

194
10:24.960 --> 10:26.250
I wanted a place to rest.

195
10:26.870 --> 10:27.650
If you only wanted a rest,

196
10:27.790 --> 10:28.940
I'd have welcomed you as guests.

197
10:29.360 --> 10:30.420
Why hurt my disciples

198
10:30.750 --> 10:31.820
and disturb our peace?

199
10:33.360 --> 10:35.060
Because I've changed my mind.

200
10:36.510 --> 10:38.460
This really is a beautiful place,

201
10:38.720 --> 10:39.980
but those immortal disciples

202
10:40.000 --> 10:40.650
are an eyesore.

203
10:41.000 --> 10:41.980
Better to kill them all.

204
10:42.440 --> 10:43.580
I'll start with you.

205
10:44.390 --> 10:45.370
How dare you!

206
10:47.360 --> 10:47.940
Protect me.

207
11:00.600 --> 11:01.530
I won't let you hurt them!

208
11:17.150 --> 11:18.180
Who are you, demoness?

209
11:18.470 --> 11:19.610
You're not from an immortal sect.

210
11:19.670 --> 11:20.580
Stay out of this.

211
11:20.720 --> 11:22.890
I've always despised evildoers.

212
11:23.120 --> 11:25.060
I uphold justice and vanquish evil.

213
11:25.270 --> 11:26.010
What other reason do I need?

214
11:38.480 --> 11:39.060
I'm hurt.

215
11:40.960 --> 11:42.340
He's... He's hurt!

216
11:42.910 --> 11:43.850
You insolent demoness!

217
11:44.000 --> 11:45.060
How dare you hurt my Fengxian!

218
11:45.240 --> 11:46.250
I'll settle this score

219
11:46.600 --> 11:47.490
with you another day!

220
11:55.390 --> 11:55.890
Miss!

221
11:57.480 --> 11:57.940
Miss.

222
12:02.150 --> 12:02.610
Miss?

223
12:15.840 --> 12:16.530
You're awake.

224
12:30.600 --> 12:31.610
We met last time

225
12:32.030 --> 12:33.100
because of the Floating Shadow Zither.

226
12:33.870 --> 12:35.250
I never expected that this time,

227
12:35.550 --> 12:36.460
you'd save my sect.

228
12:37.440 --> 12:38.730
You still remember me?

229
12:39.750 --> 12:40.220
Of course.

230
12:41.030 --> 12:42.130
You're the only one who's tried to steal the zither

231
12:42.150 --> 12:42.730
in nearly a century.

232
12:43.240 --> 12:43.940
How could I forget?

233
12:47.720 --> 12:48.580
I am Shen Wangyan.

234
12:49.510 --> 12:50.580
May I ask your name?

235
12:54.910 --> 12:55.850
I'm Youyou.

236
12:56.750 --> 12:57.610
Consider this

237
12:58.270 --> 13:00.300
my way of making amends for what I did before.

238
13:02.910 --> 13:04.010
You saved my disciples

239
13:04.030 --> 13:04.770
from being slaughtered.

240
13:05.320 --> 13:06.740
Giving you the Floating Shadow Zither

241
13:06.740 --> 13:07.450
would be the least I could do.

242
13:08.120 --> 13:08.930
If you like it,

243
13:09.080 --> 13:09.770
once you're feeling better,

244
13:10.200 --> 13:11.300
I'll bring it to your place.

245
13:11.750 --> 13:12.940
I don't want your zither.

246
13:14.320 --> 13:15.130
Then...

247
13:15.960 --> 13:18.220
If you really want to thank me,

248
13:18.790 --> 13:19.980
tomorrow's New Year's Eve.

249
13:20.720 --> 13:22.580
There's a Demon Lantern Festival in Luoliang Demon Capital.

250
13:23.030 --> 13:24.220
I was wondering if you...

251
13:26.720 --> 13:27.250
Would you

252
13:28.120 --> 13:29.530
like to...?

253
13:31.080 --> 13:32.650
Are you asking me to go to the festival

254
13:33.360 --> 13:34.490
with you on New Year's Eve?

255
13:46.320 --> 13:46.730
All right.

256
13:47.240 --> 13:47.850
I'll go with you.

257
14:01.270 --> 14:01.980
That was close.

258
14:02.200 --> 14:03.180
A couple more moves,

259
14:03.200 --> 14:03.980
and you'd have given yourself away.

260
14:04.550 --> 14:06.290
Don't use your techniques again,

261
14:06.290 --> 14:06.730
all right?

262
14:06.960 --> 14:07.580
All right.

263
14:13.630 --> 14:14.530
It worked!

264
14:14.630 --> 14:15.940
Shen Wangyan agreed to go with me

265
14:15.940 --> 14:16.980
to the Demon Lantern Festival!

266
14:16.980 --> 14:17.720
Really?

267
14:17.910 --> 14:18.490
That's great!

268
14:18.510 --> 14:19.130
It was worth playing

269
14:19.150 --> 14:19.820
the villain for you!

270
14:22.480 --> 14:23.850
And thank you to Qi Fengyin,

271
14:23.910 --> 14:24.700
the mighty devil himself.

272
14:24.910 --> 14:26.700
That move of yours was amazing.

273
14:26.790 --> 14:27.860
Could you teach it to me?

274
14:27.860 --> 14:29.600
Or could you do it again?

275
14:30.480 --> 14:31.340
So, Shen Wangyan is going

276
14:31.600 --> 14:32.580
to the demon capital with you?

277
14:32.600 --> 14:33.600
Yes!

278
14:33.780 --> 14:34.610
I finally did it!

279
14:34.720 --> 14:35.900
I snuck out

280
14:35.900 --> 14:37.180
just to share the good news with you.

281
14:37.360 --> 14:38.100
I'd better hurry back

282
14:38.240 --> 14:39.060
before someone notices.

283
14:39.270 --> 14:39.890
I'll stay

284
14:40.000 --> 14:40.820
at Yunyi Sect and keep up

285
14:40.910 --> 14:41.820
the injured act for another day.

286
14:42.120 --> 14:42.770
You head back first.

287
14:42.960 --> 14:44.100
I'm counting on you two for the festival!

288
14:51.150 --> 14:52.010
I never knew Youyou

289
14:52.080 --> 14:52.940
had this side to her.

290
14:53.390 --> 14:55.220
I wonder why, 900 years later,

291
14:55.960 --> 14:57.340
only a remnant of her soul is left.

292
14:57.670 --> 14:58.700
What if Shen Wangyan isn't

293
14:58.750 --> 14:59.250
a good man?

294
14:59.550 --> 15:01.490
Cultivators and demons have long been at odds, after all.

295
15:03.440 --> 15:05.100
Get them married and take the talisman.

296
15:06.080 --> 15:07.890
Then we'll kill him.

297
15:09.480 --> 15:09.850
All right.

298
15:10.750 --> 15:12.490
That'll get rid of the problem for good.

299
15:16.150 --> 15:16.820
But then,

300
15:17.440 --> 15:18.730
wouldn't we be killing an innocent man?

301
15:20.840 --> 15:22.220
Qi Fengyin, you're leading me astray again!

302
15:25.240 --> 15:25.940
You're messing with me?

303
15:26.600 --> 15:26.850
I'll...!

304
15:33.960 --> 15:34.700
I smell flowers.

305
15:40.600 --> 15:41.340
Pear blossoms.

306
15:43.120 --> 15:44.190
The flowers outside Luoliang

307
15:44.190 --> 15:45.220
are blooming so early.

308
15:57.480 --> 15:58.580
I just

309
15:59.480 --> 16:01.060
stepped out for some fresh air.

310
16:03.550 --> 16:04.650
I saw you in the woods

311
16:05.240 --> 16:06.250
meeting with those two.

312
16:14.790 --> 16:15.530
Yunyi Sect

313
16:15.870 --> 16:16.850
may be

314
16:16.870 --> 16:17.700
small and obscure,

315
16:17.840 --> 16:18.650
but you have no right

316
16:18.670 --> 16:19.770
to toy with it as you please.

317
16:21.840 --> 16:22.610
No,

318
16:23.080 --> 16:24.930
I've never treated your sect

319
16:24.930 --> 16:25.940
like a toy.

320
16:26.150 --> 16:27.100
What else do you want?

321
16:27.790 --> 16:29.420
I've agreed to give you the Floating Shadow Zither.

322
16:29.550 --> 16:31.060
What more can you possibly get from me?

323
16:31.390 --> 16:32.460
Do you have to toy with me like this

324
16:32.630 --> 16:34.020
just to amuse yourself?

325
16:34.270 --> 16:35.180
It's not like that.

326
16:35.480 --> 16:37.460
I never meant to toy with you.

327
16:39.510 --> 16:40.940
Never set foot in Yunyi Sect again.

328
16:41.670 --> 16:42.650
I don't want to see you again.

329
16:45.200 --> 16:45.940
Wait.

330
16:47.630 --> 16:48.100
Master,

331
16:48.320 --> 16:49.770
Elder Lingyue's taken a turn for the worse.

332
17:13.830 --> 17:14.420
Lingyue.

333
17:39.240 --> 17:40.380
What are you trying to do now?

334
17:45.350 --> 17:46.940
Demonic aura is eating away at her body.

335
17:47.440 --> 17:49.050
I can draw it out of her.

336
18:29.160 --> 18:29.660
Youyou.

337
18:40.270 --> 18:41.090
She's my senior sister.

338
18:41.830 --> 18:42.980
When she was young, she was tainted

339
18:43.000 --> 18:43.940
by demonic aura while saving me.

340
18:45.070 --> 18:46.420
It's tormented her ever since,

341
18:47.510 --> 18:48.330
giving her no peace at all.

342
18:49.550 --> 18:50.900
I owe her more than I could ever repay.

343
18:51.440 --> 18:52.050
Thank you

344
18:54.160 --> 18:54.730
for helping her.

345
18:56.070 --> 18:57.490
You don't need to thank me.

346
18:58.640 --> 19:00.460
I was wrong to deceive you before.

347
19:03.160 --> 19:03.860
But I really

348
19:03.880 --> 19:05.050
never meant to toy with you.

349
19:11.200 --> 19:11.570
Youyou,

350
19:14.480 --> 19:16.140
does your invitation to the Demon Lantern Festival

351
19:17.350 --> 19:18.380
still stand?

352
19:33.180 --> 19:40.580
[Wuchang Prison]

353
19:52.680 --> 19:53.730
Open the portal.

354
19:55.590 --> 19:57.140
You're the Saintess of the Tides now,

355
19:57.400 --> 19:58.090
wielding divine power.

356
19:58.110 --> 19:59.180
If even you can't do it,

357
19:59.440 --> 20:00.490
how could I manage it?

358
20:01.160 --> 20:02.430
The Demon Soul Talisman already

359
20:02.430 --> 20:04.080
used up all its spiritual power last time.

360
20:04.510 --> 20:05.780
Without my demonic core,

361
20:06.070 --> 20:06.940
I'm powerless.

362
20:07.400 --> 20:08.570
Keeping me prisoner won't help you.

363
20:10.440 --> 20:11.900
They don't belong in the past.

364
20:12.480 --> 20:13.860
If they stay there too long,

365
20:14.110 --> 20:15.380
they'll cause a catastrophe.

366
20:15.550 --> 20:16.380
Even so,

367
20:16.830 --> 20:18.490
there's nothing I can do.

368
20:18.680 --> 20:19.700
To return, they have no choice

369
20:19.700 --> 20:20.750
but to obtain the talisman

370
20:21.000 --> 20:22.490
from my past self 900 years ago.

371
20:26.120 --> 20:28.250
We did everything we could to save you and help you

372
20:28.720 --> 20:29.290
time and again.

373
20:29.880 --> 20:31.180
How can you be so heartless?

374
20:31.440 --> 20:32.810
You relied on His Lordship so much.

375
20:33.110 --> 20:33.810
So why are you...?

376
20:36.960 --> 20:38.100
How dare you disrespect the Saintess!

377
20:38.550 --> 20:40.180
If they never return to rescue you,

378
20:41.920 --> 20:43.530
you'll remain imprisoned here for life.

379
20:55.590 --> 20:56.900
Yuwen Hao, I despise you!

380
20:57.400 --> 20:58.900
Yamao has always considered you a friend

381
20:59.270 --> 21:00.570
and never meant you any harm.

382
21:01.200 --> 21:01.860
And you?

383
21:02.240 --> 21:03.490
Is this how you repay her?

384
21:04.070 --> 21:05.250
Now the talisman's shattered,

385
21:05.510 --> 21:06.980
and so is her hope of saving her master.

386
21:07.830 --> 21:08.570
Duyao left her

387
21:08.590 --> 21:09.730
covered in wounds.

388
21:10.310 --> 21:11.050
If she doesn't make it back

389
21:11.070 --> 21:11.980
safe and sound this time,

390
21:12.350 --> 21:13.570
I'll despise you for the rest of my life!

391
21:44.440 --> 21:45.290
Consider this display

392
21:45.590 --> 21:47.330
of silver blossoms my gift.

393
21:47.880 --> 21:49.330
May your path to immortality

394
21:49.550 --> 21:50.660
be as bright as these blossoms

395
21:51.310 --> 21:52.290
and free of all obstacles.

396
21:54.510 --> 21:55.180
Master,

397
21:55.580 --> 21:57.200
[Here Lies My Master, Du Zhong]

398
21:57.200 --> 21:58.860
I'd resolved to renounce love.

399
21:59.350 --> 22:00.530
But whenever I hear

400
22:01.960 --> 22:03.050
that she's been gravely wounded

401
22:04.240 --> 22:05.490
and that her fate is uncertain,

402
22:08.310 --> 22:09.730
I can't get her

403
22:11.000 --> 22:11.860
out of my mind.

404
22:16.070 --> 22:17.490
I can't let her go.

405
22:21.030 --> 22:21.770
Master,

406
22:26.480 --> 22:27.380
what should I do?

407
22:29.500 --> 22:32.780
[Here Lies My Master, Du Zhong]

408
22:46.550 --> 22:47.660
After all that's happened,

409
22:48.850 --> 22:50.290
why can't you just let her go?

410
22:53.030 --> 22:55.090
I just hope she dies back there, 900 years in the past,

411
22:56.590 --> 22:57.660
and never comes back.

412
23:10.350 --> 23:11.360
Don't worry.

413
23:11.680 --> 23:12.740
With my help behind the scenes,

414
23:12.960 --> 23:14.230
that fellow's faith is bound

415
23:14.270 --> 23:15.140
to waver tonight.

416
23:15.510 --> 23:16.800
I've also tampered with the bamboo frames

417
23:16.800 --> 23:17.790
for the lanterns in the market.

418
23:18.030 --> 23:18.730
When the time comes...

419
23:18.730 --> 23:19.380
Yamao,

420
23:22.000 --> 23:22.620
tonight,

421
23:23.070 --> 23:24.180
you don't need to come with me.

422
23:24.550 --> 23:26.330
I don't need those little tricks either.

423
23:28.350 --> 23:29.140
You don't like him anymore?

424
23:29.310 --> 23:30.530
I'm crazy about him!

425
23:30.880 --> 23:31.570
But...

426
23:33.960 --> 23:35.250
But after he

427
23:35.270 --> 23:36.380
saw through my lies

428
23:36.400 --> 23:37.860
and caught me in the act,

429
23:38.070 --> 23:38.860
I realized I should

430
23:38.860 --> 23:39.980
be sincere with him

431
23:40.200 --> 23:41.050
instead of plotting

432
23:41.070 --> 23:42.900
one scheme after another.

433
23:46.070 --> 23:47.570
If you don't need my help,

434
23:48.110 --> 23:48.860
the talisman...

435
23:52.640 --> 23:53.420
Don't worry.

436
23:53.830 --> 23:55.220
When the time is right,

437
23:55.720 --> 23:56.730
I promise I'll lend you the talisman

438
23:56.790 --> 23:57.660
to send you both back.

439
24:03.780 --> 24:04.520
Come on!

440
24:06.500 --> 24:07.000
Bravo!

441
24:12.720 --> 24:13.380
Does it look nice?

442
24:13.400 --> 24:14.010
Do you like it?

443
24:20.660 --> 24:24.900
♪Moonlight spills before Luoliang's towers♪

444
24:24.980 --> 24:29.140
♪The evening breeze caresses your face...♪

445
24:29.590 --> 24:30.900
We finally have some time to relax.

446
24:31.310 --> 24:32.530
Why the long face?

447
24:33.440 --> 24:34.460
So all those clothes

448
24:35.240 --> 24:35.760
you picked out

449
24:35.760 --> 24:37.180
were for that log of a master of yours.

450
24:39.240 --> 24:40.180
You think I don't know?

451
24:40.270 --> 24:41.380
I told you to look after him,

452
24:41.680 --> 24:43.050
but you ended up ripping his clothes.

453
24:43.350 --> 24:44.530
My master cares a lot about appearances.

454
24:44.960 --> 24:46.140
If he wakes up to find himself

455
24:46.240 --> 24:47.190
in rags,

456
24:47.190 --> 24:48.210
he'll be upset.

457
24:49.000 --> 24:49.870
He couldn't stay upright.

458
24:49.870 --> 24:50.660
How is that my fault?

459
24:50.920 --> 24:51.770
What would you like?

460
24:51.880 --> 24:52.490
Qi Fengyin!

461
24:55.000 --> 24:56.480
Which flavor do you think is best?

462
24:56.480 --> 24:57.420
Ask your master.

463
25:02.030 --> 25:02.730
I'll take some of this flavor.

464
25:03.110 --> 25:03.620
All right.

465
25:04.240 --> 25:04.730
Here you go.

466
25:04.820 --> 25:05.380
Thanks.

467
25:12.300 --> 25:15.420
♪Time drifts gently, your backward glance cool and clear♪

468
25:15.780 --> 25:17.780
♪Grace in every step...♪

469
25:19.270 --> 25:20.250
I got these for you as a reward.

470
25:20.310 --> 25:20.810
Is it

471
25:20.960 --> 25:21.460
sweet?

472
25:21.980 --> 25:24.380
♪The scent of pear blossoms fills the air♪

473
25:24.700 --> 25:26.860
♪Threads of karma are drawn together♪

474
25:27.140 --> 25:30.980
♪Twining around our palms, layer upon layer♪

475
25:31.540 --> 25:34.780
♪Time drifts gently, your backward glance cool and clear...♪

476
25:35.590 --> 25:36.980
I'm not unreasonable.

477
25:37.200 --> 25:38.570
I've noticed every single thing

478
25:38.570 --> 25:39.490
you've done for me.

479
25:39.880 --> 25:41.250
I know you like sweets,

480
25:41.680 --> 25:42.620
so I bought you these.

481
25:43.350 --> 25:45.220
After all, we're the best of friends.

482
25:45.900 --> 25:47.780
♪Bonds and memories♪

483
25:48.590 --> 25:49.770
What other flavors do you like?

484
25:49.880 --> 25:50.660
Let's get some more.

485
25:51.510 --> 25:52.900
Youyou's paying tonight, anyway.

486
25:54.920 --> 25:56.450
I wasn't trying to please you.

487
25:56.750 --> 25:57.980
What do I need a reward for?

488
26:00.310 --> 26:00.860
Fine.

489
26:01.310 --> 26:02.980
It's me who's trying to please you. Happy?

490
26:14.550 --> 26:15.920
Judging by the weather,

491
26:16.720 --> 26:17.700
it might snow tonight.

492
26:18.440 --> 26:18.940
That'd be nice.

493
26:22.920 --> 26:23.570
What's so nice about that?

494
26:25.160 --> 26:25.900
Don't you know?

495
26:26.480 --> 26:27.730
It's believed

496
26:28.270 --> 26:29.010
that if it snows

497
26:29.030 --> 26:30.050
on New Year's Eve,

498
26:30.350 --> 26:31.320
every wish you make this year

499
26:31.550 --> 26:32.770
will come true next year.

500
26:39.110 --> 26:40.530
I've never celebrated New Year's Eve.

501
26:43.200 --> 26:44.050
I've never seen snow.

502
26:55.030 --> 26:55.900
So this is where

503
26:56.960 --> 26:57.660
Youyou

504
26:57.680 --> 26:58.900
used to live.

505
27:06.890 --> 27:07.460
Bravo!

506
27:13.750 --> 27:14.700
Have you considered

507
27:15.680 --> 27:16.530
that she could change

508
27:17.240 --> 27:18.700
her own future with her choices?

509
27:30.680 --> 27:31.380
Demons usually rule

510
27:31.400 --> 27:32.620
their own separate mountain domains.

511
27:33.400 --> 27:34.420
I've never seen so many

512
27:34.440 --> 27:35.250
living together before.

513
27:36.510 --> 27:37.620
It seems you've done

514
27:37.640 --> 27:38.940
what no other powerful demon could.

515
27:40.350 --> 27:41.010
Well,

516
27:41.440 --> 27:42.620
ever since I was born,

517
27:42.680 --> 27:44.050
I've always been on my own.

518
27:44.350 --> 27:45.500
That's why I've always wished

519
27:45.500 --> 27:46.740
for someone to keep me company.

520
27:47.440 --> 27:49.180
Ever since I was little, my dream

521
27:49.440 --> 27:50.490
has been to build

522
27:50.490 --> 27:51.310
a demon capital like this.

523
27:51.960 --> 27:52.990
It's finally come true.

524
27:52.990 --> 27:58.810
- Bravo! - Bravo!

525
27:59.640 --> 28:01.220
There's also plenty of spiritual energy here.

526
28:01.510 --> 28:02.220
As long as my people

527
28:02.350 --> 28:03.420
tend their spirit fields,

528
28:03.510 --> 28:04.530
they can provide for themselves

529
28:05.000 --> 28:06.140
and won't go out and harm anyone.

530
28:07.720 --> 28:08.530
It's just

531
28:09.070 --> 28:11.090
that my people are still a little afraid of me.

532
28:12.350 --> 28:13.620
I haven't learned

533
28:13.680 --> 28:14.940
how to get along with them yet.

534
28:15.830 --> 28:16.770
I've always hoped

535
28:16.790 --> 28:17.730
to find someone

536
28:17.920 --> 28:19.860
to help me handle the city's day-to-day affairs

537
28:20.510 --> 28:22.140
and put my people at ease.

538
28:24.480 --> 28:25.250
So you set your sights on me

539
28:25.270 --> 28:26.290
because you wanted me

540
28:26.920 --> 28:27.980
to help you run the city?

541
28:32.510 --> 28:33.770
Is that why you snuck

542
28:33.790 --> 28:34.700
into Yunyi Sect day after day

543
28:35.200 --> 28:36.420
to watch me in secret?

544
28:40.000 --> 28:41.220
You knew all along?

545
28:44.270 --> 28:45.310
Do you really

546
28:45.310 --> 28:46.700
underestimate me that much,

547
28:47.270 --> 28:48.250
or are you just that oblivious?

548
29:02.240 --> 29:02.660
Watch out!

549
29:32.640 --> 29:33.900
I suppose you really are

550
29:33.900 --> 29:34.580
that oblivious.

551
29:39.920 --> 29:41.250
You've watched me day after day,

552
29:42.480 --> 29:43.380
yet you've never realized

553
29:44.400 --> 29:45.810
that I've been watching you too.

554
30:23.880 --> 30:25.330
It doesn't look like it'll snow tonight.

555
30:35.590 --> 30:36.090
Qi Fengyin,

556
30:36.310 --> 30:37.220
head back and wait for me

557
30:37.590 --> 30:39.660
at the Moonwatch Tower, the highest point at the Demon Queen's Palace.

558
30:40.880 --> 30:41.490
Where are you going?

559
30:42.070 --> 30:43.010
You'll see.

560
30:48.940 --> 30:53.140
[Moonwatch Tower]

561
30:54.750 --> 30:55.330
Qi Fengyin,

562
30:55.350 --> 30:56.090
come and see the snow!

563
30:57.300 --> 30:59.380
♪In this fleeting, haunted life, good and evil♪

564
30:59.380 --> 31:03.340
♪Blur, ensnaring you and me♪

565
31:04.420 --> 31:10.340
♪Love rides the waves, cleaving a path through this vast world♪

566
31:11.300 --> 31:15.020
♪Dawn and dusk gain color at our fingertips...♪

567
31:15.920 --> 31:17.180
I've never celebrated New Year's Eve.

568
31:18.960 --> 31:19.730
I've never seen snow.

569
31:20.790 --> 31:21.530
Pear blossoms.

570
31:21.920 --> 31:23.050
The flowers outside Luoliang

571
31:23.310 --> 31:24.180
are blooming so early.

572
31:24.980 --> 31:27.100
♪One day, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

573
31:27.420 --> 31:31.860
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

574
31:32.300 --> 31:38.380
♪Sleepless through bloodshed and strife, we pray our love will remain unbroken♪

575
31:38.940 --> 31:42.660
♪Across vast mountains and rivers, how lucky we are to have found each other♪

576
31:43.020 --> 31:45.740
♪Together, we'll walk through time's depths and shallows...♪

577
31:45.750 --> 31:46.420
Shen Wangyan,

578
31:46.420 --> 31:47.740
♪Before all splendor fades...♪

579
31:48.920 --> 31:50.420
next year is going to be a good one.

580
31:53.830 --> 31:54.330
Yes.

581
31:55.590 --> 31:56.420
It'll be a good year.

582
32:11.700 --> 32:13.490
♪In this fleeting, haunted life, good and evil♪

583
32:13.490 --> 32:17.500
♪Blur, ensnaring you and me♪

584
32:18.580 --> 32:24.500
♪Love rides the waves, cleaving a path through this vast world...♪

585
32:27.400 --> 32:27.980
Do you like it?

586
32:28.310 --> 32:28.770
Isn't it beautiful?

587
32:29.140 --> 32:31.380
♪Our vows live on in ink...♪

588
32:31.400 --> 32:31.900
It is.

589
32:36.030 --> 32:37.180
I hope the world

590
32:37.680 --> 32:38.660
will always be

591
32:39.510 --> 32:40.420
this peaceful and safe.

592
32:48.750 --> 32:50.180
After leaving Luoliang Demon Capital,

593
32:52.000 --> 32:52.570
I looked

594
32:52.590 --> 32:54.180
into what happened on Mount Qihuang.

595
32:56.310 --> 32:57.420
What did you find out?

596
33:00.720 --> 33:02.490
The blood of immortals and mortals ran in rivers.

597
33:03.440 --> 33:04.660
Countless were killed or wounded.

598
33:06.830 --> 33:08.090
But I don't remember any of it.

599
33:12.830 --> 33:14.050
I never did any of it,

600
33:16.070 --> 33:16.940
but now...

601
33:19.030 --> 33:20.180
You don't trust yourself anymore.

602
33:26.310 --> 33:27.140
That's all the more reason

603
33:27.680 --> 33:29.220
[Moonwatch Tower] to hurry and reclaim

604
33:29.240 --> 33:29.940
all your malice.

605
33:30.880 --> 33:31.980
Once you've perfected your techniques,

606
33:32.350 --> 33:33.460
perhaps your lost memories

607
33:33.480 --> 33:34.460
will all come back.

608
33:34.720 --> 33:35.460
Then you can judge

609
33:35.790 --> 33:37.330
whether those stories are true

610
33:38.160 --> 33:39.700
and whether you're innocent

611
33:39.960 --> 33:41.010
or deserve to be punished.

612
33:46.070 --> 33:47.530
Aren't you afraid I'll become the Devil Incarnate

613
33:48.590 --> 33:49.940
and do something that can't be undone?

614
33:52.590 --> 33:53.520
How can you be so sure

615
33:53.520 --> 33:54.990
you'll become the Devil Incarnate?

616
33:55.680 --> 33:56.330
The fact

617
33:56.350 --> 33:57.730
that those stories about your past

618
33:57.750 --> 33:58.620
upset you now

619
33:58.880 --> 33:59.770
already shows how much

620
33:59.790 --> 34:00.660
you've changed.

621
34:02.510 --> 34:03.330
Besides...

622
34:08.510 --> 34:09.610
If you can smell

623
34:09.630 --> 34:10.610
the malice in people,

624
34:11.150 --> 34:11.990
then I can smell

625
34:11.990 --> 34:13.050
the goodness in them.

626
34:14.630 --> 34:16.340
Based on everything we've been through,

627
34:16.880 --> 34:18.050
I hereby declare

628
34:18.670 --> 34:19.570
that you're a good man.

629
34:20.400 --> 34:21.570
As for all those rights and wrongs,

630
34:22.070 --> 34:23.010
we can sort them out later.

631
34:25.190 --> 34:25.860
You're right.

632
34:27.360 --> 34:28.980
Rumors can't be trusted.

633
34:30.480 --> 34:31.570
I only trust myself.

634
34:36.230 --> 34:36.940
And you.

635
34:40.670 --> 34:41.490
That's more like it.

636
34:42.110 --> 34:42.860
No more moping.

637
34:43.070 --> 34:43.860
Cheer up.

638
34:44.070 --> 34:45.200
We still need to get the talisman

639
34:45.200 --> 34:46.050
and go back to save Youyou.

640
34:51.920 --> 34:52.530
Please,

641
34:52.840 --> 34:54.210
keep Youyou safe,

642
34:54.320 --> 34:55.780
both here in the past

643
34:56.030 --> 34:57.090
and 900 years from now.

644
34:57.400 --> 34:59.260
Please let me get the talisman soon

645
34:59.400 --> 35:00.610
and hurry back to save my master.

646
35:00.880 --> 35:01.900
And please let Qi Fengyin

647
35:02.480 --> 35:04.900
reclaim all his malice as soon as possible.

648
35:53.110 --> 35:53.570
Youyou.

649
35:57.510 --> 35:58.090
Youyou.

650
36:06.070 --> 36:07.260
I brought you some pastries

651
36:08.070 --> 36:09.130
to help you regain spiritual power

652
36:09.760 --> 36:10.340
and make things

653
36:10.670 --> 36:11.340
a little easier here.

654
36:16.630 --> 36:17.860
Talk about a wolf in sheep's clothing.

655
36:18.360 --> 36:19.060
Who knows

656
36:19.060 --> 36:20.100
what you are really after?

657
36:20.400 --> 36:21.210
If I told you

658
36:21.840 --> 36:23.340
I had no idea that young friend of yours

659
36:23.550 --> 36:24.420
was the Saintess of the Tides,

660
36:25.150 --> 36:26.050
would you believe me?

661
36:26.400 --> 36:27.420
So what if I believe you?

662
36:28.150 --> 36:29.300
Are you going to take pity on me

663
36:29.360 --> 36:30.050
and let me go?

664
36:31.510 --> 36:32.090
Will you?

665
36:33.670 --> 36:34.650
The spell binding you

666
36:34.880 --> 36:35.780
was cast by the Saintess.

667
36:36.230 --> 36:36.900
I can't break it.

668
36:37.670 --> 36:38.860
All I can do

669
36:39.150 --> 36:40.130
is sneak you some food

670
36:40.480 --> 36:41.690
to make things a bit easier in here.

671
36:46.030 --> 36:46.610
Are you sure

672
36:46.960 --> 36:47.860
you don't want any?

673
36:48.280 --> 36:48.690
I'm sure.

674
37:07.760 --> 37:08.460
Have some water.

675
37:08.510 --> 37:09.130
Slow down.

676
37:15.670 --> 37:16.340
There are more.

677
37:16.880 --> 37:17.210
Here.

678
37:18.840 --> 37:19.980
I've been so mean to you.

679
37:20.630 --> 37:21.780
Why are you still helping me?

680
37:26.400 --> 37:27.050
Can't you even think

681
37:27.070 --> 37:28.090
of a single reason?

682
37:28.510 --> 37:29.740
Don't I have any good qualities?

683
37:29.920 --> 37:30.300
You do.

684
37:31.400 --> 37:31.900
I...

685
37:32.920 --> 37:33.690
Maybe you

686
37:35.230 --> 37:36.260
remind me of my little sister.

687
37:37.150 --> 37:38.210
You have a little sister?

688
37:39.880 --> 37:41.010
But once she grew up,

689
37:41.190 --> 37:42.300
she was nothing like the girl

690
37:42.320 --> 37:43.170
she used to be.

691
37:43.880 --> 37:44.690
She used to be free-spirited

692
37:45.150 --> 37:45.980
and thoughtless,

693
37:46.230 --> 37:47.090
just like you.

694
37:49.190 --> 37:50.290
I didn't mean it that way.

695
37:50.480 --> 37:50.980
I mean...

696
37:51.480 --> 37:52.210
You're your own person.

697
37:53.400 --> 37:54.010
I'm sorry.

698
37:54.670 --> 37:55.980
Did I say the wrong thing again

699
37:56.150 --> 37:57.050
and upset you?

700
37:57.630 --> 37:58.340
Of course not.

701
37:58.920 --> 38:00.490
You're kind to me without asking for anything.

702
38:00.670 --> 38:01.690
I couldn't be happier.

703
38:02.110 --> 38:03.730
I'd love it if everyone in the world

704
38:03.730 --> 38:04.780
treated me like their little sister.

705
38:18.000 --> 38:18.690
Qingxing,

706
38:19.800 --> 38:21.300
can I really trust you?

707
38:25.880 --> 38:27.490
Then could you do me a favor?

708
38:38.030 --> 38:38.740
Is this

709
38:39.230 --> 38:40.460
a piece of the Demon Soul Talisman?

710
38:46.820 --> 38:48.820
[Qingnian Residence]

711
39:14.320 --> 39:16.650
Saintess, may I ask

712
39:17.070 --> 39:18.050
why you've summoned me?

713
39:21.000 --> 39:22.300
I hear Mount Zhaowu

714
39:23.440 --> 39:25.260
has had a rule since Du Zhong's time

715
39:26.590 --> 39:28.130
against admitting female disciples.

716
39:32.150 --> 39:33.010
That is correct.

717
39:33.480 --> 39:34.690
What is the punishment

718
39:36.030 --> 39:37.380
for breaking the rule?

719
39:38.190 --> 39:39.170
Expulsion from Mount Zhaowu.

720
39:40.230 --> 39:41.740
Since you knew all that,

721
39:43.590 --> 39:45.010
why did you break the rule anyway?

722
39:46.670 --> 39:47.420
I don't understand.

723
39:47.800 --> 39:49.090
I've broken no rules.

724
40:24.400 --> 40:25.170
I was wrong.

725
40:26.000 --> 40:27.090
Saintess,

726
40:28.000 --> 40:29.210
I beg you to keep my secret.

727
40:29.880 --> 40:31.650
I'd walk through fire for you

728
40:32.630 --> 40:33.610
without a second thought.

729
40:53.280 --> 40:55.050
Would you really do anything for me?

730
40:59.360 --> 41:00.490
Whatever you need, Saintess,

731
41:01.590 --> 41:02.570
I promise I'll do everything

732
41:03.230 --> 41:04.170
in my power.

733
42:33.230 --> 42:33.740
Master,

734
42:34.440 --> 42:35.940
demons attacked the villagers.

735
42:36.510 --> 42:37.210
No one survived.

736
42:39.880 --> 42:41.980
Luoliang Demon Capital is nearby.

737
42:43.670 --> 42:45.870
When these demons band together,

738
42:46.110 --> 42:47.420
disaster is sure to follow.

739
42:47.920 --> 42:48.820
They must be stopped!

740
42:49.070 --> 42:49.490
Yes!

741
43:20.190 --> 43:21.210
It's the people from Wuwang Sect.

742
43:21.840 --> 43:22.780
What did you do to offend them?

743
43:22.920 --> 43:24.750
Why are they besieging Luoliang Demon Capital?

744
43:25.320 --> 43:26.900
We demons don't have to do anything.

745
43:27.400 --> 43:28.260
Our very existence

746
43:28.800 --> 43:29.780
is enough to offend them.

747
43:35.580 --> 43:41.220
[Luoliang Demon Capital]

748
43:47.360 --> 43:48.300
I'll go drive them back.

749
43:48.960 --> 43:49.460
Don't.

750
43:50.110 --> 43:50.810
Those people

751
43:50.810 --> 43:51.780
are bound to recognize you.

752
43:52.440 --> 43:53.650
If they find out you're still alive,

753
43:54.030 --> 43:54.690
this will be

754
43:55.000 --> 43:56.260
much harder to resolve.

755
43:56.440 --> 43:57.300
Do you plan to face them

756
43:57.320 --> 43:58.050
all by yourself?

757
43:58.230 --> 43:59.420
They're a major immortal sect!

758
43:59.670 --> 44:00.300
If I can't repel invaders,

759
44:00.320 --> 44:01.210
how can I be the Demon Queen?

760
44:01.630 --> 44:02.610
Don't underestimate me.

761
44:05.630 --> 44:06.860
Then we'll defend the city from within.

762
44:07.400 --> 44:08.260
Don't worry.

763
44:14.550 --> 44:15.260
You two should go.

764
44:15.760 --> 44:16.980
Our deal is off.

765
44:19.960 --> 44:20.940
What are you talking about?

766
44:23.230 --> 44:24.130
I lied.

767
44:24.550 --> 44:25.570
I don't have

768
44:25.590 --> 44:26.340
the Demon Soul Talisman.

769
44:28.710 --> 44:29.610
So when you said

770
44:29.630 --> 44:30.740
I'd sent you back with the talisman,

771
44:30.840 --> 44:31.860
I didn't believe you at all.

772
44:32.070 --> 44:32.380
I...

773
44:36.190 --> 44:37.260
I can't create the talisman.

774
44:38.190 --> 44:39.340
This city has nothing to do

775
44:39.360 --> 44:40.050
with you anymore.

776
44:40.510 --> 44:41.650
I don't want to drag you into this.

777
44:43.440 --> 44:44.090
Just go.

778
44:50.590 --> 44:51.590
Did Youyou from the present

779
44:51.590 --> 44:52.210
lie to us?

780
44:52.550 --> 44:53.340
Does that mean the talisman

781
44:53.480 --> 44:54.610
wasn't made from her demonic core?

782
45:00.030 --> 45:00.930
I can't just leave her.

783
45:01.130 --> 45:02.090
Youyou from the present

784
45:02.190 --> 45:03.210
was attacked by immortals.

785
45:03.440 --> 45:04.530
They destroyed her body

786
45:04.710 --> 45:05.420
and stole her talisman.

787
45:06.150 --> 45:07.530
I'll deal with the array in the city.

788
45:08.760 --> 45:09.740
Go and look after her.

789
45:10.920 --> 45:11.740
Be careful.

790
45:22.670 --> 45:23.420
You rotten old man!

791
45:23.800 --> 45:25.260
You follow your immortal path.

792
45:25.440 --> 45:26.380
I follow my demonic path.

793
45:27.000 --> 45:28.260
Why are you sealing off my capital?

794
45:41.280 --> 45:42.210
Insolent demon.

795
45:42.800 --> 45:43.900
You gathered demons, built a city,

796
45:44.000 --> 45:44.980
and made yourself queen.

797
45:45.480 --> 45:47.050
The whole city is thick with demonic aura.

798
45:47.630 --> 45:49.340
I must seal you away here for good!

799
45:50.000 --> 45:50.980
What kind of nonsense is that?

800
45:52.030 --> 45:53.490
How many mountains have you cultivators claimed

801
45:53.840 --> 45:55.130
for your training over the years?

802
45:55.590 --> 45:56.780
Why won't you let us demons

803
45:56.840 --> 45:58.170
claim a territory of our own?

804
45:59.070 --> 45:59.860
The very territory

805
45:59.920 --> 46:01.090
you've created

806
46:01.400 --> 46:03.680
led to demons killing every innocent villager nearby

807
46:03.880 --> 46:05.860
on New Year's Eve.

808
46:06.320 --> 46:08.420
Wuwang Sect will never allow

809
46:08.550 --> 46:09.690
demons to wreak havoc far and wide.

810
46:10.070 --> 46:10.610
Today,

811
46:10.960 --> 46:12.530
I'll slay you all right here!

812
46:12.880 --> 46:13.530
That's nonsense!

813
46:14.150 --> 46:15.610
Luoliang Demon Capital's gates were shut tight

814
46:15.670 --> 46:16.530
on New Year's Eve.

815
46:16.920 --> 46:17.840
No demon could have gone out

816
46:17.840 --> 46:18.860
to slaughter innocent people.

817
46:19.440 --> 46:20.290
Stop pinning

818
46:20.290 --> 46:21.300
baseless charges on us!

819
46:21.670 --> 46:22.650
The evidence is irrefutable.

820
46:22.800 --> 46:24.010
No more excuses, you wicked demon!

821
46:43.070 --> 46:43.530
Look.

822
46:44.110 --> 46:44.860
This is snow.

823
46:45.150 --> 46:46.650
Whenever fresh snow falls in Luoliang,

824
46:47.000 --> 46:48.340
the Wish Tree appears.

825
46:48.440 --> 46:49.380
I'll take you to the Wish Tree

826
46:49.400 --> 46:50.090
and broaden your horizons.

827
46:50.440 --> 46:50.980
Will you

828
46:51.000 --> 46:52.280
marry me

829
46:52.280 --> 46:53.050
beneath the Wish Tree?

830
46:55.960 --> 46:57.120
Why are you hiding your face?

831
46:57.150 --> 46:57.930
You monster!

832
46:57.930 --> 46:58.830
What's your true form?

833
46:58.830 --> 46:59.740
Monster!

834
47:33.380 --> 47:39.140
♪Life and death find no harbor in your cloudy eyes♪

835
47:40.620 --> 47:46.260
♪Words across a thousand years gently caress the abyss♪

836
47:46.900 --> 47:53.780
♪One thought sows karma. Who knows right from wrong? Love entwines the stars♪

837
47:53.900 --> 47:59.820
♪We cross paths through lifetimes, rekindling the sparks of time♪

838
48:01.340 --> 48:06.980
♪In this fleeting, haunted life, good and evil blur, ensnaring you and me♪

839
48:08.660 --> 48:14.340
♪Love rides the waves, cleaving a path through this vast world♪

840
48:14.660 --> 48:19.100
♪Dawn and dusk gain color at our fingertips♪

841
48:19.220 --> 48:22.180
♪Our vows live on in ink♪

842
48:22.300 --> 48:28.020
♪No matter what storms may rise behind us♪

843
48:28.860 --> 48:31.300
♪One day, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

844
48:31.300 --> 48:35.900
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

845
48:35.900 --> 48:38.260
♪Sleepless through bloodshed and strife♪

846
48:38.260 --> 48:42.460
♪We pray our love will remain unbroken♪

847
48:42.700 --> 48:44.980
♪Across vast mountains and rivers♪

848
48:44.980 --> 48:46.780
♪How lucky we are to have found each other♪

849
48:46.780 --> 48:49.700
♪Together, we'll walk through time's depths and shallows♪

850
48:49.700 --> 48:51.860
♪Before all splendor fades♪

851
48:51.860 --> 48:56.500
♪With no regrets, we etch a lifetime of devotion♪

852
48:57.020 --> 48:59.420
♪In this life, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

853
48:59.460 --> 49:04.060
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

854
49:04.060 --> 49:06.420
♪We cannot escape the wind and snow♪

855
49:06.460 --> 49:10.620
♪We pray our love will remain unbroken♪

856
49:10.860 --> 49:13.140
♪As seas turn to fields♪

857
49:13.140 --> 49:14.940
♪How lucky we are to have found each other♪

858
49:14.940 --> 49:17.860
♪Together, we'll break free of the cocoon fate has spun♪

859
49:17.860 --> 49:19.980
♪Before all splendor fades♪

860
49:19.980 --> 49:29.020
♪With no regrets, we etch a lifetime of devotion♪
